        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Dog breeds: Chien Français Blanc et Orange, Cretan Hound, Kritikos Lagonikos\n- Places: Saintonge, Crete, Greece\n- Topics: Hunting dogs, pack hunting, breed origins\n\nFacts:\n- The Chien Français Blanc et Orange is used for hunting in packs.\n- The Chien Français Blanc et Orange descends from the old Hound of Saintonge type of large hunting dog.\n- The Kritikos Lagonikos is another name for the Cretan Hound.\n- The Cretan Hound is a hunting breed of dog from the island of Crete in Greece.",
